<title>UK: Banque Mediterranee sets $50 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banque Mediterranee sets $50 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE DE LA MEDITERRANEE</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     9.25	MATURITY    15.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+260 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/LEB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  LEBANON   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
